<%- include('partials/top') %><section class="dash-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">INVESTMENT PRODUCTS</span><h1>Explore the packages.</h1><p>Choose carefully and read the full terms before committing funds.</p></div><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/dashboard">← Dashboard</a></section><div class="plan-grid"><% plans.forEach((p,i)=>{ %><article class="plan-card <%= i===2?'featured':'' %>"><div class="plan-index">0<%= i+1 %></div><h3><%= p[0] %></h3><div class="plan-amount"><%= formatNaira(p[1]) %></div><div class="plan-meta">Investment amount</div><div class="plan-income"><span>Daily income estimate</span><strong><%= formatNaira(p[2]) %></strong></div><div class="plan-income"><span>30-day estimate</span><strong><%= formatNaira(p[2]*30) %></strong></div><% if(currentUser){ %><form action="/invest" method="post" class="plan-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="plan" value="<%= p[0] %>"><button class="btn <%= i===2?'btn-primary':'btn-secondary' %> btn-full">Use balance</button></form><% } else { %><a href="/register" class="plan-link">Get started <span>↗</span></a><% } %></article><% }) %></div><div class="risk-note"><strong>Important risk disclosure:</strong> Daily and 30-day figures are projections based on the figures supplied by the site operator, not guaranteed returns. They equal 25% of principal per day and 750% over 30 days, an exceptionally high and potentially unsustainable rate. No profits are automatically credited. Verify the business, legal authorisation, and written terms before sending money.</div><%- include('partials/bottom') %>
